OL,5,G0132 More than the Score
OL,6,     FWhen Ellie Bouttell was 15, she
OL,7,     Fmoved from England to live with
OL,8,     Fher dad in Beijing. The decision
OL,9,     Fshaped her life in ways she could
OL,10,     Fnever have imagined.
OL,11,G0150 Sporting Witness
OL,12,     FHost nation Brazil were World Cup
OL,13,     Ffavourites in 2014. Germany's
OL,14,     FThomas Muller describes how his
OL,15,     Fteam dismantled Brazil's defense
OL,16,     Fand spirit by scoring five goals
OL,17,     Fin 29 minutes.
